.inc CoilcraftTemplates.lib

*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : 0402HL-271
* Inductance = 270nH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 1MHz-1000MHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor RF Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt 0402HL-271 port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=0.16pF Ind=270nH
X1 port1 port2 Model2A PARAMS:
+ R1=78
+ R2=1.95
+ C= {Cpar}
+ K1=0.0006
+ K3= {Ind}
.ends 0402HL-271

